Subject: [PATCH] configure: omit host paths from the runtime build description

The configure command embeds SDK staging/build paths in every capture binary.
Keep build provenance in the build records instead, and give runtime diagnostics
a stable distribution label. This does not change configuration feature tests.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [distribution build metadata]

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -1280,5 +1280,5 @@
 dnl final checks
 dnl trivial solution to portability issue
-AC_DEFINE_UNQUOTED(COMPILE_ARGS, "$COMPILE_ARGS")
+AC_DEFINE_UNQUOTED(COMPILE_ARGS, "OpenWrt source build")
 CFLAGS="${CFLAGS} ${INCLUDES}"
 INCLUDES=""
